reproduction in any medium, provided the original work is properly cited.</license-p></license></permissions><related-article related-article-type="retracted-article" id="d32e57" vol="4" page="130" issue="2" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="12845309" ext-link-type="pubmed"><article-title>Small cell carcinoma of the urinary bladder: CT and MR imaging findings</article-title></related-article></article-meta></front><body><p>The article "Small Cell Carcinoma of the Urinary Bladder: CT and MR Imaging Findings" by Jong Chul Kim, Kie Hwan Kim, and Seungeun Jung, published in Korean Journal of Radiology (2003;4:130-135) is for the most part identical to an article by Jong Chul Kim, entitled "CT features of bladder small cell carcinoma" published in Clinical Imaging (2004;28:201-205). The corresponding author (JC Kim) has been contacted and has agreed that the two studies are the same.</p></body></article>